Request title: Washing machine leaking badly - CALLBACK on your JOB-8798 (30/08/2026). Our ticket TKT-365DCE, booking BKG-842139.
Address: Flat 7, Riverside Court, 3 Wharf Lane, Bristol BS1 6XY (3rd floor)
Appointment: Monday 12/10/2026, 09:00-11:00. Access is via the building concierge desk.
Tenant: Grace Adeyemi, +44 7700 900621 (for access only)

Request description: Beko WTK94121W. Badly leaking during spin on 09/10, water across the kitchen floor and under the units. The machine is switched off and not in use. Water may have come through to the kitchen ceiling of Flat 6 below.
This fault comes back within 90 days of your temporary fix on 30/08 (pump housing leak), so please treat this as a callback under your workmanship terms. Please tell us in writing if you intend to charge anything beyond the call-out.

Please:
(1) identify the leak source, including the inlet hose, isolation valve and waste;
(2) confirm in writing whether this leak explains the water reaching the flat below;
(3) make the machine safe and isolate it;
(4) do NOT carry out any repair over £250 without our written authorisation;
(5) send a written quote to replace it (supply, fit, removal of the old unit), in line with your beyond-economical-repair note;
(6) send photos of your findings.

If you have already scheduled an appointment, reply with the date and time.
